      "ports": [
        { "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "value", "side": "top", "offset": 0.5 },
        { "id": "action", "label": "action", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "side": "left", "offset": 0.5 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "interface-frame-smoke-root",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Root / Default View",
      "position": { "x": 80, "y": 80 },
      "width": 320,
      "height": 160,
      "data": {
        "identity": { "graphId": "interface-frame-smoke" },
        "key": "node.web",
        "intent": "node",
        "payload": "node.web",
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "view": { "intent": "node", "payload": "node.web" },
        "renderShape": { "kind": "markdown", "sourcePath": "node.web" },
        "markdown": "# Authored Interface Frame\n\nThis View supplies the root node's default surface because it is the target of the Declaration's `default-view` relationship."
      },
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "value", "side": "bottom", "offset": 0.5 }]
    },
    {
      "id": "interface-frame-smoke-action-port",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "Action Port",
      "position": { "x": -300, "y": 80 },
      "width": 260,
      "height": 180,
      "data": {
        "portId": "action",
        "surfaceId": "action",
        "payload": "node.web",
        "intent": "node",
        "accepts": ["any"],
        "identity": { "graphId": "interface-frame-smoke" },
        "memo": "Second authored Port for inspecting how graph position should project onto the node interface."
      },
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "side": "right", "offset": 0.5 }]
    },
    {
      "id": "interface-frame-smoke-instructions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Smoke Test",
      "position": { "x": 600, "y": 420 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "identity": { "graphId": "interface-frame-smoke" },
        "markdown": "# Smoke test\n\n1. Open the bare graph address or enter through its root Port. The **Root / Default View** node should receive focus.\n2. Switch to **Edit** mode. The Twilite watermark should disappear.\n3. The root View is the default surface because it is the target of the Declaration's `default-view` relationship.\n4. A rounded node outline should appear centered on that View.\n5. A root-direction line should run from the default View toward the Declaration and meet the outline at its bottom edge.\n6. Drag the Declaration farther down. The outline should grow while preserving its 420:260 aspect ratio.\n7. The additional Action Port should remain projected on the boundary.\n8. Navigating explicitly through `:action` should focus the Action Port instead.\n9. Switch to Browse mode. The interface outline should disappear."
      },
      "ports": [{ "id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "value", "side": "left", "offset": 0.5 }]
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
